<title>UK: El Salvador tenders to sell U.S. quota sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>El Salvador tenders to sell U.S. quota sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador tendered on Wednesday to sell 6,250 tonnes of U.S. quota raw sugar for shipment in January/February, traders said.</p>
<p>Bids would be accepted on an executable order basis against New York's March no.14 contract, they said.</p>
<p>No more details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
